## 🛠️ General Usage Workflow

### 01 — Prepare The Windows PC

Install the required Samsung USB drivers and make sure the Windows computer is ready for device servicing.

### 02 — Connect The Authorized Samsung Device

Connect the compatible Samsung phone or tablet using a reliable USB cable.

### 03 — Detect The Device

Launch Octoplus Samsung Tool and verify that the connected device is recognized correctly.

### 04 — Check Device Information

Review the model number, chipset, firmware, security information, and connection mode.

### 05 — Confirm Compatibility

Check the exact model, binary/security level, firmware version, and supported servicing method.

### 06 — Select The Appropriate Service

Choose an operation appropriate for the legitimate repair requirement and supported device configuration.

### 07 — Complete The Operation

Follow the application's supported workflow while maintaining stable USB communication.

### 08 — Verify The Device

After completion, check device detection, firmware information, connectivity, and normal operation.

